// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.

inherit ROOM;
void create()
{
    set("short", "密道");
    set("long", @LONG
你的眼前是一条用汉白玉铺成的台阶，一直向下延伸，两边的墙壁都
是花岗岩，墙上隔十来步就有一盏油灯，使你能看清周围。
LONG
    );
    set("exits", ([
        "southup" : __DIR__"midao1",
